                                                                                                                         "License"@en ;
                                                                          <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Process Regulation that permits some Process."@en .


###  http://www.ontologyrepository.com/CommonCoreOntologies/ActionProhibition
<http://www.ontologyrepository.com/CommonCoreOntologies/ActionProhibition> rdf:type owl:Class ;
