###  http://www.ontologyrepository.com/CommonCoreOntologies/Organism
<http://www.ontologyrepository.com/CommonCoreOntologies/Organism> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                  rdfs:subClassOf <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000030> ;
